  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday through Wednesday)\nIssued at 1208 AM CST Thu Nov 26 2026\n\nGusty north winds on Sunday morning should lighten up in the \nafternoon as high surface pressure builds in.  Our area should see \nabout a 10-degree cooldown on Sunday with highs in the lower to mid-\n50s.  South winds return Monday and could be windy.  Another upper \nwave both weak and dry may come through on Tuesday potentially \npushing a weak cold front through with increasing south winds on \nWednesday.  Temperatures should warm to seasonably normal on Tuesday \nand warmer on Wednesday.",
